+++ b/releasenotes/notes/all-in-one-deployer-inventory-7df5e3655e059a3f.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Adds an ``all-in-one-deployer`` example inventory, for running
+    ``kolla-ansible`` from a container on the host it deploys to. It reaches
+    that host with the ``community.docker.nsenter`` connection plugin rather
+    than SSH, names the host ``kolla`` rather than ``localhost`` so that tasks
+    delegated to ``localhost`` still run in the container, and sets an absolute
+    ``ansible_remote_tmp``, because the plugin passes the container's ``HOME``
+    to commands on the host. The container must share the host's PID namespace
+    and be privileged.
